    Normally when you specify different recapture probabilities the results should appear when you use the summary() function or when you simply type the output's name of the analysis. They are stored in the coefficients table. If they do not show up, then there is something wrong either with the way you specified the function, or there might be a bug in the code. Can you send me an example on how you specified the function?

